examples:
逐个构造字符串并遍历：
```text
string myString;
myString.insert(cend(myString), 'h');
myString.insert(cend(myString), 'e');
myString.push_back('l');
myString.push_back('l');
myString.push_back('o');
for (const auto& letter : myString) {
    cout << letter;
}
```

也可以使用迭代器遍历：
```text
for (auto it = cbegin(myString); it != cend(myString); ++it) {
    cout << *it;
}
```
